<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3742"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Whoisbtk<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Whoisbtk<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 07, 2005 - 10:26 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->To: <BR>Tom_voigt <BR>Skov <BR>Q <BR>Dpinva <BR>Devbost <BR>Rec95 <BR>Catcher <BR>george <BR> <BR> <BR>I had always dismissed the hit man theory because it’s to gaudy and has no evidence to support it. <BR> <BR>But, In Charlie Otero’s 12/1/2004 interview  &#40;<a href="http://dodgeglobe.com/stories/120104/state_1201040" target=_top>http://dodgeglobe.com/stories/120104/state_1201040</a> 08.shtml&#41; he said his father was involved with “Inter-American Air Forces Academy” &#40;<a href="http://www.lackland.af.mil/iaafapub/english/index.htm" target=_top>http://www.lackland.af.mil/iaafapub/english/index. htm</a>&#41;.  There is a lot of information linking it to School of the Americas &#40;<a href="http://www.soawatch.org" target=_top>www.soawatch.org</a>&#41;  Both SOA and IAAFA were military training centers in Panama when Mr. Otero was &#40;an instructor?&#41; <BR> <BR>SOA trained/graduated most of the people who violated human rights in multiple countries in latin America. General Norieaga &#40;sp?&#41; as a graduate.  If internet data on SOA is correct, they trained people to do what btk did.  The SOA “interrogators” use tape recordings, and photographs.  They are taught to strike early in the morning, etc <BR>  <BR>One web site shows how the bag method used on the Otero son <BR> <BR>The manuals on torture used by SOA can be found at: <BR>Volume 1 &#40;<a href="http://www2.gwu.edu/~nsarchiv/NSAEBB/NSAEBB122/CIA%20Human%20Res%20Exploit%20H0-L17.pdf" target=_top>http://www2.gwu.edu/~nsarchiv/NSAEBB/NSAEBB122/CIA %20Human%20Res%20Exploit%20H0-L17.pdf</a>&#41; <BR> <BR>Volume 2 &#40;<a href="http://www2.gwu.edu/~nsarchiv/NSAEBB/NSAEBB122/Kubark%2082-104.pdf" target=_top>http://www2.gwu.edu/~nsarchiv/NSAEBB/NSAEBB122/Kub ark%2082-104.pdf</a>&#41; <BR> <BR>This got real interesting after I read some of this.  But, Oh Lord, the sea of Thy data is so VAST  <BR>And my laptop is so small… <BR> <BR>Please look at this.  It could explain btk, and why the killings were the way they were. <BR> <BR>I really think it might be important <BR> <BR><a href="mailto:whoisbtk@yahoo.com">whoisbtk@yahoo.com</a> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
