<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3759"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, January 08, 2005 - 6:18 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hi Whoisbtk <BR> <BR>Excelent find!  <BR>However I don´t think BTK was a revenge or hit murderer, the killings are far to sadistic/sexual ect IMO. BUT who knows if BTK was a person that Joseph Otero knew and who also was trained in Panama and therefore had the KNOWLEGE of the torture technics wich then again suited BTK´s desires for sadism? <BR> <BR>I´m still very interested in knowing who the man was that Charie Otero said he recognized at the policestation when he was taken there after the murders &#40;dont know if it was the same day or one of the following days&#41; Anyone knows more about this man? <BR> <BR>Keep up the good work! <BR> <BR>skov<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3759-->
