<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3950"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 11, 2005 - 4:39 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Affie4u, BTK may have told the kids he&#39;d hurt their mother if they didn&#39;t do what he said. I don&#39;t think Josie was hiding in the basement; my guess would be that BTK brought here there. But we&#39;ll never know. BTK was such a coward.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
