<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4179"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, January 15, 2005 - 5:29 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Dorothy, I think BTK did some window peeping and possibly some stalking for all of his attacks. Not much more than that in determining victims.  <BR> <BR>But no one knows for sure. Do you mean you believe BTK and Joseph knew each other well? Just asking, as I like all theories and keep an open mind. Thanks.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
