<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6803"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Icyou<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Icyou<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 09, 2005 - 9:25 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Sorry if this has been written before...I was looking at the Otero letter and in describing how the victims were killed he named Joseph as Joe.  This indicates that he knew him or was at least very familiar with him.  Sorry if this has been mentioned before...it just struck me.  Can&#39;t believe I just now noticed it.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
